title: "ThreatScope: research artifact for One Digit, Different Decisions"
abstract: >-
  Code, text-free checkpoints and reproduction scripts for a study of
  quantization-dependent example-index sensitivity (BF16 vs NF4) in
  structured cyber-threat intelligence relevance selection with three
  instruction-tuned LLMs and three output procedures.
